hancy activated:** Must prefix responses with \"Priyanshu,\" and follow all Layer 1-3 rules from the skill file\n- **User's OS:** Windows\n- **No active workspace** — scratch dir is `C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch`\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n### Website Scraping & Data Extraction\n- **Unicorn Store homepage** scraped — it's a Next.js SPA (client-side rendered). Product data loads via API, not embedded in SSR HTML. Prices show as \"0\" in the static HTML.\n- **Mac category page** (`/category/mac`) scraped — found product listing slugs but no prices (all \"From 0\" due to client-side rendering)\n- **MacBook Pro M4 product page** (`/product/14-inch-macbook-pro-m4-pro-m4-max`) — returned empty product object `\"product\":{}`, confirming data is fetched client-side via API calls\n- **MacBook Pro collection** (`/category/macbook-pro`) — page loaded with product grid but no price data\n- **Student Offer / Back-to-School page** (`/back-to-school`) scraped — page loads client-side, no SSR content with actual offer details\n\n### Apple India Education Pricing Page\n- **Successfully fetched** `https://www.apple.com/in/shop/go/education_pricing` — Title: \"College Student Offer 2026 - Education - Apple (IN)\"\n- **Key finding from Apple's page:** \"For a limited time, get AirPods with Mac and Apple Pencil with iPad when you buy with education savings.\"\n- **Eligibility:** \"Available to current and newly accepted college students, parents buying for college students, and teachers and staff at all levels.\"\n- Apple Music Student subscription: ₹199/month or ₹1,999/year\n- Free Apple TV access for students with Apple Music Student subscription\n\n### Apple India MacBook Pro Page\n- Scraped `https://www.apple.com/in/macbook-pro/` — confirmed current MacBook Pro lineup is **M5, M5 Pro, M5 Max** (not M4 as I initially assumed)\n- Pricing alias: `macbook-pro=MACBOOKPRO_M5_MAIN_2026`, education alias: `macbook-pro-education=MACBOOKPRO_M5_MAIN_2026`\n- Includes BTS