in/api/...` or similar)\n  2. Use browser-based scraping (`/browser` command or agent-reach-skill)\n  3. Fall back to Apple's education pricing API endpoints\n\n### Apple India Education Pricing API\n- Regular pricing endpoint: `/in/shop/mcm/product-price`\n- Education pricing endpoint: `/in-edu/shop/mcm/product-price`\n- These could potentially be called with the product identifier `MACBOOKPRO_M5_MAIN_2026` to get actual prices\n\n### Unicorn Store Business Details (from page JSON)\n- Legal name: Unicorn Infosolutions Private Limited\n- GST: 27AAACU6278M1ZP\n- CIN: U52392DL2003PTC121350\n- Payment gateway: PINELABS\n- Shipping via DELHIVERY, delivery 1-3 days\n- Cancellation fee: 3%\n- Tax type: INCLUSIVE (prices include GST)\n- Prepaid only (no COD)\n- Max order quantity: 1 per product\n- Support: 18002677888, unicornsupport@unicornstore.in\n\n### What's Still Unknown\n1. **Exact Unicorn Store education/student prices** — could not extract from static scraping\n2. **What exact student discount Unicorn offers** vs Apple's standard education pricing — the `/back-to-school` page content loads client-side\n3. **In-box contents** specific to Unicorn Store purchases (standard Apple box contents vs any Unicorn-added extras)\n4. **Whether Unicorn's student discount stacks** with other offers like the HSBC 7%\n\n### Web Search Failures\nAll `search_web` calls returned `\"no summary returned from GenerateContent\"` errors — search tool was not working during this session. This significantly hampered research.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Viewed Files (all in artifact system-generated steps)\n\n**Step 3 content** (`...steps\\3\\content.md`) — Unicorn Store homepage HTML. Massive file (1.4MB). Contains navbar JSON with full site structure, product categories, and HSBC offer T&Cs embedded in page data. Key data is in the `__NEXT_DATA__` JSON blob.\n\n**Step 10 content** (`...steps\\10\\content.md`) — Back-to-school page (421KB). Contains navbar + shop data but actual student